# i18n content packs

- Resume: `src/constants/locale-resume/{en,id,jp}.ts`
- UI: `src/constants/locale-ui/{en,id,jp}.ts`
- When adding fields/sections, update **all three** locales in the same change.
- Do not put new portfolio content only in `src/constants/resume.ts` (legacy dashboard).
- View-model mapping: `src/containers/portfolio/schema.ts`.
